---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Dealer Hub
permalink: /dealer-hub/
description: "The HCPS Dealer Hub — a dealer dashboard for orders, pricing access, literature, in-service training, technical support, and manufacturer resource centers across all 12 manufacturer partners."
---
<section class="dash-v3-hero">
  <div class="container dash-v3-hero-grid">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">HCPS Dealer Hub</p>
      <h1>A dealer dashboard for orders, pricing, literature, training, and manufacturer support.</h1>
      <p class="lead">Use the Dealer Hub as your central starting point for manufacturer resources, order requests, literature, pricing access, in-service scheduling, technical support, and future dealer login tools.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="btn primary" href="/dealer-support/?request=Place%20or%20Request%20an%20Order">Start Dealer Request</a>
        <a class="btn outline on-light" href="#dash-request-center">Open Request Center</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <aside class="dash-v3-user-card">
      <div class="dash-v3-user-top">
        <span class="dash-v3-avatar">HC</span>
        <div>
          <strong>Dealer Portal Preview</strong>
          <p>Future personalized login</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="dash-v3-metrics">
        <span><b>{{ site.stats.manufacturers }}</b> Manufacturer Centers</span>
        <span><b>6</b> Dealer Workflows</span>
        <span><b>{{ site.stats.states }}</b> Strategic States</span>
        <span><b>{{ site.stats.dealers }}</b> Dealer Relationships</span>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="dash-v3-shell">
  <div class="container dash-v3-layout">

    <aside class="dash-v3-sidebar">
      <p>Dealer Hub</p>
      <a href="#dash-request-center">Request Center</a>
      <a href="#dash-manufacturers">Manufacturers</a>
      <a href="#dash-resources">Resources</a>
      <a href="#dash-pricing">Pricing</a>
      <a href="#dash-training">Training</a>
      <a href="#dash-service">Service</a>
      <a href="#dash-future-login">Future Login</a>
    </aside>

    <div class="dash-v3-main">

      <section class="dash-v3-panel dash-v3-welcome">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Dashboard</p>
          <h2>What can HCPS help you with today?</h2>
        </div>
        <a class="dash-v3-help-link" href="/contact/">Contact HCPS &rarr;</a>
      </section>

      <section class="dash-v3-action-grid" id="dash-request-center">
        <a class="dash-v3-action primary" href="/dealer-support/?request=Place%20or%20Request%20an%20Order">
          <span>&#128230;</span><strong>Dealer Order Request</strong><p>Submit order needs, PO details, special orders, quote needs, stock, lead times, or follow-up questions.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="dash-v3-action" href="/dealer-support/?request=Pricing%20Access">
          <span>&#128178;</span><strong>Pricing Access</strong><p>Request dealer price sheets, MAP/MSRP files, freight terms, or protected pricing documents.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="dash-v3-action" href="/dealer-support/?request=Order%20Literature">
          <span>&#128218;</span><strong>Literature Request</strong><p>Request brochures, catalogs, flyers, sell sheets, spec sheets, or patient-facing product materials.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="dash-v3-action" href="/dealer-support/?request=Request%20an%20In-Service">
          <span>&#127891;</span><strong>Schedule In-Service</strong><p>Request product education, clinical training, dealer training, or sales team support.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="dash-v3-action" href="/dealer-support/?request=Technical%20Support">
          <span>&#128295;</span><strong>Technical Support</strong><p>Get routed to service resources, warranty forms, parts support, or technical documentation.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="dash-v3-action" href="/resources/">
          <span>&#11015;</span><strong>Resource Library</strong><p>Open the library of downloads, catalogs, forms, videos, and manufacturer materials.</p>
        </a>
      </section>

      <section class="dash-v3-two-col">
        <div class="dash-v3-panel" id="dash-pricing">
          <div class="dash-v3-panel-head">
            <div>
              <p class="eyebrow">Pricing</p>
              <h3>Dealer pricing center</h3>
            </div>
            <span class="dash-v3-badge">Future Login</span>
          </div>
          <div class="dash-v3-list">
            <a href="/dealer-support/?request=Pricing%20Access&amp;topic=MAP%20Pricing"><b>MAP Pricing</b><span>Request protected manufacturer MAP files</span></a>
            <a href="/dealer-support/?request=Pricing%20Access&amp;topic=MSRP%20Price%20Sheets"><b>MSRP Price Sheets</b><span>Request current MSRP resources</span></a>
            <a href="/dealer-support/?request=Pricing%20Access&amp;topic=Dealer%20Price%20Sheets"><b>Dealer Price Sheets</b><span>Get dealer pricing set up for your account</span></a>
            <a href="/dealer-support/?request=Pricing%20Access&amp;topic=Promotions"><b>Promotions</b><span>Current and future manufacturer offers</span></a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="dash-v3-panel" id="dash-training">
          <div class="dash-v3-panel-head">
            <div>
              <p class="eyebrow">Training</p>
              <h3>Education and in-service support</h3>
            </div>
            <span class="dash-v3-badge active">Active</span>
          </div>
          <div class="dash-v3-training-card">
            <strong>Request product education</strong>
            <p>Schedule dealer training, sales team product education, clinical support, or a manufacturer in-service.</p>
            <a href="/dealer-support/?request=Request%20an%20In-Service">Request Training &rarr;</a>
          </div>
          <div class="dash-v3-mini-calendar">
            <span>Coming Soon</span>
            <p>Upcoming trainings, webinars, and manufacturer education events.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="dash-v3-panel" id="dash-manufacturers">
        <div class="dash-v3-panel-head">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">Manufacturer Centers</p>
            <h3>Open the resource center for each manufacturer.</h3>
          </div>
          <a class="dash-v3-view-all" href="/manufacturers/">View Directory &rarr;</a>
        </div>

        <div class="dash-v3-mfg-grid">
          {% for m in manufacturers %}
          <article>
            <a class="dash-v3-mfg-logo" href="/manufacturers/{{ m.id }}/">
              <img src="{{ m.logo }}" alt="{{ m.name }} logo" loading="lazy">
            </a>
            <div class="dash-v3-mfg-body">
              <h4>{{ m.name }}</h4>
              <p>{{ m.category }}</p>
              <span>Pricing, literature, tech service, training</span>
            </div>
            <div class="dash-v3-mfg-buttons">
              <a href="/manufacturers/{{ m.id }}/">Open</a>
              <a href="/dealer-support/?request=General%20Dealer%20Question&amp;manufacturer={{ m.name | urlencode }}">Support</a>
            </div>
          </article>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="dash-v3-three-col" id="dash-resources">
        <article>
          <span>&#128196;</span><h3>Downloads</h3><p>Brochures, catalogs, forms, flyers, sell sheets, and product spec documents.</p><a href="/resources/">Open Resources &rarr;</a>
        </article>
        <article id="dash-service">
          <span>&#128295;</span><h3>Service</h3><p>Warranty forms, service documents, technical support routing, and parts request workflows.</p><a href="/dealer-support/?request=Technical%20Support">Request Service &rarr;</a>
        </article>
        <article>
          <span>&#128226;</span><h3>Announcements</h3><p>Manufacturer promotions, product launches, training dates, and dealer updates.</p><a href="/dealer-support/?request=General%20Dealer%20Question&amp;topic=Updates">Request Updates &rarr;</a>
        </article>
      </section>

      <section class="dash-v3-portal-preview" id="dash-future-login">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--hcps-gold);">Future Dealer Login</p>
          <h2>Personalized access is the next evolution.</h2>
          <p>In a future phase, dealers will be able to log in and access assigned manufacturer lines, dealer-specific pricing, protected downloads, open requests, training history, promotions, and support tickets.</p>
          <a class="btn primary" href="/contact/?topic=Dealer">Become an HCPS Dealer</a>
        </div>
        <div class="dash-v3-fake-app">
          <div class="dash-v3-window-bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
          <div class="dash-v3-app-inner">
            <h3>Welcome, ABC Home Medical</h3>
            <div class="dash-v3-app-row"><b>3</b><span>New pricing files</span></div>
            <div class="dash-v3-app-row"><b>2</b><span>Open dealer requests</span></div>
            <div class="dash-v3-app-row"><b>1</b><span>Scheduled training</span></div>
            <div class="dash-v3-app-row"><b>{{ site.stats.manufacturers }}</b><span>Approved manufacturer lines</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
